        'button_press_event', 'pick_event', ...). Returns an id for disconnect().
        Callbacks run on the thread that delivers events -- during show(), wait_closed(),
        run(), poll_events() or dispatch_events(), or at an interactive prompt -- so a
        script that never waits sees none. An exception is reported through
        sys.unraisablehook and delivery goes on; KeyboardInterrupt is raised by the wait.
        """

